OL,5,G1600 Jazz Record Requests
OL,6,     FAlyn Shipton presents jazz records
OL,7,     Fof all styles as requested by you,
OL,8,     Fincluding cuts Stan Tracey,
OL,9,     FBlossom Dearie, Laufey, Dave
OL,10,     FHolland and more.
OL,11,G1700 The Early Music Show
OL,12,     FHannah French explores the life of
OL,13,     FQueen Christina of Sweden, who was
OL,14,     Fborn 400 years ago this year and
OL,15,     Fbecame one of the most important
OL,16,     Fmusical benefactors in Rome.
OL,17,G1800 Choral Evensong
